# LoRA staging table — read by plumbing/fetch_loras.sh.
#
#   enabled  set     repo  dest  remote-file  sha256
#
# Tab-separated. One row per FILE, so a pair is two rows with the same set name.
# Local path = <repo root>/<dest>/<remote-file>.
#
#   on   staged by default (install.sh / setup_colab.sh)
#   off  opt-in: flip to "on", or stage just it now:
#          ./plumbing/fetch_loras.sh --only <set>
#   #    retired / ignored entirely, kept only as a record
#
# sha256 pins come from the published model cards. A mismatch is a warning, not
# a failure: a corrected upstream re-upload should not brick the installer.
# Use "-" when a repo publishes no pin (the third-party mirrors).

